    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "            Spanish demonstratives distinguish between objects that are close to the speaker (este/esta/estos/estas), near the listener or at a medium distance (ese/esa/esos/esas), and far away (aquel/aquella/aquellos/aquellas). \nThey also agree in gender and number with the noun they modify. \nThese translation drills help reinforce correct selection of demonstrative adjectives and pronouns.\n"
    }
